## Layer 3: DagProgress state machine

Renderer-agnostic state. Knows nothing about terminals or HTML.

```rust
struct DagProgress {
    nodes: HashMap<NodeId, NodeProgress>,
    edges: HashMap<(NodeId, NodeId), EdgeProgress>,
    topo_order: Vec<NodeId>,
    phase: DagPhase,
    elapsed: Duration,
}

enum DagPhase { NotStarted, Running { current_node: NodeId },
                Completed { elapsed: Duration }, Failed { node: NodeId, error: String } }
enum NodeState { Pending, Running, Completed, Failed, Skipped, Intercepted }
enum EdgeState { Idle, Flowing, Done, Dead }
```

### Power flow transitions

    1. DAG starts:     all nodes=Pending, all edges=Idle
    2. Node A starts:  A=Running
    3. Node A done:    A=Completed, edges(A→*)=Flowing  ← the visual moment
    4. Node B starts:  B=Running, edges(*→B)=Done
    ...repeat until DAG=Completed or Failed

