Key principle: no new types where existing ones suffice. DagSnapshot uses
Edge directly. Observer formalizes what CiContext already does ad-hoc.
Symbol system follows exact same patterns as language module. DagLayout
reuses the generation/level concept from DagBuilder (just recomputed from
topo order since Dag<T> doesn't persist it).

